I am running nethack with Windows 3.0.  I got the "violated system integrity"
message until I edited nethack.cnf and removed the 'rawio' option.  I have to
run nethack as a full screen application, but it seems to work ok.  I was also
using the latest version of the PCKKEY keyboard enhancer from Multisoft but
found that I had to disable the accelerator function to avoid multiple key
presses.
 
